{
  "name": "dsh-img2img-config",
  "version": "0.6.0",
  "description": "img2img-studio 的 GUI 插件（一个包两个面）：① 输入框里的图片编辑器（编号标记 / 移除背景 / 涂抹擦除 / 调整大小）；② 设置页「识图与生图」供应商面板（供应商目录选择 + 脚本扫描标注、账号库驱动 chatgpt-web 通道、每行测试/试跑/复制命令、保存前预览、余额探测；中/英双语），保存即写回两个 skill 的 scripts/.env",
  "private": true,
  "type": "module",
  "main": "./lib/index.js",
  "types": "./lib/types/index.d.ts",
  "files": [
    "lib",
    "src",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "manifest.schema.json"
  ],
  "license": "MIT",
  "engines": {
    "dsh": ">=0.2.1-rc.1"
  },
  "peerDependencies": {
    "@deepseek-ai/cordis": ">=4.0.0-rc",
    "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-slots": ">=0.0.1-rc"
  },
  "devDependencies": {
    "@types/node": "^24.13.3",
    "@types/react": "^18.3.1",
    "react": "^18.3.1",
    "tsdown": "^0.22.14",
    "typescript": "^5.9.0"
  },
  "scripts": {
    "build": "bash scripts/build.sh",
    "build:client": "tsdown && node scripts/normalize-client-banner.mjs",
    "typecheck": "tsc -p tsconfig.json --noEmit && tsc -p tsconfig.client.json",
    "verify": "node scripts/verify-i18n.mjs && node scripts/verify-catalog.mjs && node scripts/verify-http.mjs",
    "sync": "node scripts/sync-skill.mjs"
  },
  "exports": {
    ".": {
      "types": "./lib/types/index.d.ts",
      "default": "./lib/index.js"
    },
    "./client": {
      "types": "./lib/types/client/index.d.ts",
      "default": "./lib/client.js"
    },
    "./cordis.patch.yml": "./cordis.patch.yml",
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    },
    "client": {
      "inject": [
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-locale",
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-slots",
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-conversation",
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-session",
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-settings",
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-theme"
      ],
      "platform": "web"
    }
  }
}
